      "entry": "0700-network-mts/0002-net-ps4-mts-native-autoload.patch",
      "path": "platforms/ps4/patches/6.18-baikal-mts2/0700-network-mts/0002-net-ps4-mts-native-autoload.patch",
      "sha256": "e6e799c9d82618f1c92abfaa801cb49613feb4d4f4f033bdd79e5d5f3a0ee9b3",
      "subject": "net: ps4: native psx_mts_net autoload and self-arming open",
      "origin": "native-autoload",
      "change": "added",
      "note": "Exports the 104d:90d8 PCI ID with MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE so udev loads the module; adds the read-only autoarm parameter (default 1) so the first open publishes without an allow_open write; registers psx0 from the module LIVE notifier instead of probe. The one-retained-DMA-generation contract and the probe, fresh-baseline and first-open checks are unchanged. psx_mts_net.autoarm=0 restores the explicit gate. Only this target applies it; the active series keeps 0001 alone."
    }
